    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>This magical tattoo holds the essence of a level 1–3 spell chosen by its creator. While the tattoo is on your body, you always have that spell prepared, and you can cast it with any spell slots you have of the appropriate level. If you have the Spellcasting or Pact Magic feature, the spell uses your spellcasting ability; otherwise, a spell that calls for a saving throw or an attack roll has a save DC of 13 and an attack bonus of +5. If your Attunement to the tattoo ends, the tattoo vanishes.</p><p>You can also cast the spell once without a spell slot or spell components; once you do, the tattoo vanishes.</p><p>The Thayan art of magical tattooing is jealously guarded by its practitioners, so Thayan Spell Tattoos can’t be crafted like other magic items. Learning to ink them requires a Renown score of 50 or more with the Red Wizards.</p><p>To ink a Thayan Spell Tattoo, you must have proficiency in the Arcana skill and with Calligrapher’s Tools and have the spell prepared on each day of the inking. You also need any Material components the spell requires; if the spell consumes them, they are consumed when you finish the tattoo. Inking a tattoo takes the same time and money as scribing a @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.dmgSpellScroll00]{Spell Scroll} of the same level.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-i0uhcMPvKDVL0fUd\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Déposez le sort du tatouage sur l’activité <em>Tattoo Spell</em> : elle le lance une fois sans emplacement ni composantes, puis le tatouage disparaît. Pour le lancer avec vos emplacements, ajoutez aussi le sort à vos sorts, toujours préparé.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
